        {
            "id": "000009851003",
            "name": "Foes’ Fate",
            "cost": 15,
            "legend": "The skjalds tell in hushed voices how this warrior was born beneath a blood-omen moon, how his fate is interwoven with those of his prey-to-be and how he waits now at the end of each such enemy’s thread, the final and inescapable executor of their deaths.",
